  At a fixed alert budget the better RANKER wins. A signal that only
  matches 'random' is carrying no information about the outcome.
  WATCH THE TIGHTEST BUDGETS. A real ranker is BEST at the top; a signal
  that only wins at loose budgets and collapses at 1-2% is over-scaling
  its extreme predictions, not ranking well.

